{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# 基于 AAR 基线的 Shapley 鲁棒特征新背包扩展\n","\n","- 目标：在不改动 `aar_robust_inventory_14days_final.ipynb` 输入和评估指标体系的前提下，补充一个**特征驱动**的鲁棒订货策略（Shapley-Lipschitz）。\n","- 方法：\n","  - 样本内：求解 Lipschitz 正则的线性规划，得到在历史\"不同特征取值\"上的最优鲁棒订货量 `y_k` 与 Lipschitz 常数 `L`。\n","  - 扩展：对新特征 `x`，用 Shapley/Lipschitz 极小极大小 LP 求得 `y(x)`。\n","- 对齐：本 notebook 复用 AAR 基线的 `simulate_trajectory` / `evaluate` 指标，允许并排对比 AAR 与 Shapley 的名义/最坏/MC（VaR/CVaR/均值/方差/服务率）等指标。\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["import numpy as np\n","import pandas as pd\n","from pathlib import Path\n","\n","from robust_feature_newsvendor import (\n","    ShapleyRobustFeatureNewsvendor,\n","    ShapleyRobustFeatureNewsvendorConfig,\n",")\n","\n","pd.set_option('display.max_columns', 120)\n","pd.set_option('display.width', 160)"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## 1) 配置与输入（与 AAR 一致的关键量 + 特征数据）\n","- AAR 评估使用的关键量：`K`, `d_hat`, `delta`, `I1`, `costs=(f,c,h,p)`；\n","- Shapley 训练/预测需要：历史 `X_train, z_train` 与评估期 `X_eval`（通常 K 天的特征），可直接取自单日预测聚合 Notebook 导出的特征工程数据（含 `demand` 列）。\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["# === AAR 评估所需（请按你在 AAR 笔记本中的相同方式设定/传入）===\n","K = 14  # 决策期数\n","I1 = 0.0  # 初始库存\n","# 若你在外部环境已准备好 d_hat/delta/costs，可在下方覆盖\n","D_HAT_OVERRIDE = None   # 例如: np.array([...], dtype=float) 长度 K\n","DELTA_OVERRIDE = None   # 例如: np.array([...], dtype=float) 长度 K\n","COSTS_OVERRIDE = None   # 例如: (f, c, h, p)\n","\n","# === Shapley 鲁棒参数 ===\n","shapley_cfg = ShapleyRobustFeatureNewsvendorConfig(\n","    h_cost=1.0,  # 与 AAR 中的持有成本 h 对齐\n","    b_cost=4.0,  # 与 AAR 中的缺货惩罚 p 对齐\n","    rho=0.5,     # 1-Wasserstein 半径\n","    beta=1.0,    # L 的下界（或尺度因子）\n","    norm='l2',   # 距离范数：'l2'|'l1'|'linf'\n","    rounding_eps=None,  # 特征聚类粒度；设为 None 表示不聚合\n","    time_limit_sec=180,\n","    solver_msg=False,\n",")\n","\n","# === 特征数据（来自 单日预测聚合.ipynb 的特征工程输出）===\n","# 建议直接填入你导出的特征工程数据文件路径（含 'demand' 列），如：\n","# FEATURE_DATA_PATH = '/Users/.../电解镍_特征工程数据.xlsx'\n","FEATURE_DATA_PATH = None  # 必填；若为 None，将构造一个演示用的合成数据\n","FEATURE_SHEET = None      # Excel 时可指定表名；csv 可忽略\n","LABEL_COL = 'demand'\n","DATE_COL = None           # 若存在日期列可填入用于切片；否则按行序\n","FEATURE_COLS = None       # 若为 None，将自动选择数值列且排除 LABEL_COL\n","\n","# 评估期选择：默认取数据末尾 K 条作为评估期，其前所有样本为训练集\n","USE_LAST_K_AS_EVAL = True\n","EVAL_START_IDX = None  # 若不采用末尾 K，可指定评估起点行号（含），将取 [start, start+K)\n","\n","# MC 参数（用于 evaluate 的 Monte Carlo 评估）\n","MC_SAMPLES = 300\n","MC_SEED = 2025\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## 2) 读取/构造特征数据与切分训练/评估\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["def _read_feature_table(path: str|Path, sheet: str|None):\n","    path = Path(path)\n","    if path.suffix.lower() in {'.xls', '.xlsx'}:\n","        return pd.read_excel(path, sheet_name=sheet)\n","    else:\n","        return pd.read_csv(path)\n","\n","if FEATURE_DATA_PATH is None:\n","    # 合成一份演示数据（1 维特征 + 噪声）\n","    rng = np.random.default_rng(0)\n","    n_all = 120\n","    X_demo = np.linspace(0, 10, n_all)\n","    true_q = 2.0 + 0.6 * X_demo\n","    z_demo = true_q + rng.normal(0, 0.8, size=n_all)\n","    df = pd.DataFrame({'x1': X_demo, LABEL_COL: z_demo})\n","else:\n","    df = _read_feature_table(FEATURE_DATA_PATH, FEATURE_SHEET)\n","\n","# 选择特征列\n","if FEATURE_COLS is None:\n","    numeric_cols = df.select_dtypes(include=['number']).columns.tolist()\n","    FEATURE_COLS = [c for c in numeric_cols if c != LABEL_COL]\n","    if len(FEATURE_COLS) == 0:\n","        raise ValueError('未找到数值特征列，请检查 FEATURE_COLS 配置。')\n","\n","# 仅保留所需列，并清理缺失\n","work_df = df[FEATURE_COLS + [LABEL_COL]].copy()\n","work_df = work_df.replace([np.inf, -np.inf], np.nan).dropna()\n","\n","n = len(work_df)\n","if n < K + 10:\n","    raise ValueError(f'数据量太少（{n}），无法切出训练 + {K} 天评估。请提供更多历史或减小 K。')\n","\n","if USE_LAST_K_AS_EVAL:\n","    train_df = work_df.iloc[: n - K]\n","    eval_df  = work_df.iloc[n - K : n]\n","else:\n","    if EVAL_START_IDX is None:\n","        raise ValueError('未开启末尾 K 评估且未指定 EVAL_START_IDX。')\n","    start = int(EVAL_START_IDX)\n","    eval_df = work_df.iloc[start : start + K]\n","    train_df = pd.concat([work_df.iloc[:start], work_df.iloc[start+K:]], axis=0)\n","    if len(eval_df) != K:\n","        raise ValueError('自定义评估切片长度不等于 K。')\n","\n","X_train = train_df[FEATURE_COLS].to_numpy(dtype=float)\n","z_train = train_df[LABEL_COL].to_numpy(dtype=float)\n","X_eval  = eval_df[FEATURE_COLS].to_numpy(dtype=float)\n","\n","print('训练集:', X_train.shape, '评估集:', X_eval.shape)\n","train_df.head(2), eval_df.head(2)"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## 3) d_hat / delta / costs / I1（与 AAR 对齐）\n","- 默认尝试从特征数据里构造 `d_hat`（若存在如 `demand_ma7` 列），否则用 `LABEL_COL` 的简单滚动均值/常数作为替代。\n","- 强烈建议你将 AAR 中使用的 `d_hat`/`delta`/`costs` 直接覆写到本 notebook 中，确保完全一致。\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["# 构造评估期 d_hat / delta 的兜底逻辑（不保证与你的 AAR 完全一致，建议覆盖）\n","def build_baseline_dhat_delta(eval_df: pd.DataFrame, label_col: str, K: int):\n","    dh = None\n","    # 常见：若存在移动平均列，可优先使用\n","    for cand in ['demand_ma7','demand_ma14','demand_ma30','pred','forecast']:\n","        if cand in eval_df.columns:\n","            dh = eval_df[cand].to_numpy(dtype=float)\n","            break\n","    if dh is None:\n","        # 用标签列自身的滚动均值替代（示例）\n","        tmp = pd.concat([train_df[label_col], eval_df[label_col]], axis=0).rolling(7, min_periods=1).mean().to_numpy(dtype=float)\n","        dh = tmp[-K:]\n","    # 用评估期 |z - d_hat| 的分位数/均值生成每期 delta（示例）\n","    abs_err = np.abs(eval_df[label_col].to_numpy(dtype=float) - dh)\n","    delta = np.maximum(abs_err, np.percentile(abs_err, 75))\n","    return dh, delta\n","\n","if D_HAT_OVERRIDE is not None:\n","    d_hat = np.asarray(D_HAT_OVERRIDE, dtype=float)\n","else:\n","    d_hat, _ = build_baseline_dhat_delta(eval_df.assign(pred=np.nan), LABEL_COL, K)\n","\n","if DELTA_OVERRIDE is not None:\n","    delta = np.asarray(DELTA_OVERRIDE, dtype=float)\n","else:\n","    _, delta = build_baseline_dhat_delta(eval_df, LABEL_COL, K)\n","\n","if COSTS_OVERRIDE is not None:\n","    f, c, h, p = COSTS_OVERRIDE\n","else:\n","    # 与 Shapley 配置对齐（示例值）；请按需覆盖为 AAR 使用的成本\n","    f, c, h, p = 0.0, 0.0, shapley_cfg.h_cost, shapley_cfg.b_cost\n","\n","print('d_hat:', d_hat.shape, 'delta:', delta.shape, 'costs:', (f,c,h,p), 'I1:', I1)\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## 4) 训练 Shapley 鲁棒特征新背包并对评估期出订货量\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["mdl = ShapleyRobustFeatureNewsvendor(shapley_cfg).fit(X_train, z_train)\n","Xg, y_star, L_star = mdl.get_in_sample_policy()\n","print('K_groups:', len(Xg), 'L* =', L_star)\n","\n","u_shapley = mdl.predict(X_eval).astype(float)\n","v_shapley = (u_shapley > 0).astype(int)  # 二进制开关的朴素近似：下单即开\n","u_shapley, v_shapley[:5]"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## 5) 复用 AAR 的评估函数（simulate_trajectory / evaluate）\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["def affine_policy_orders(u0_vec, A_mat, z_vec):\n","    Kloc = len(u0_vec)\n","    u = np.array(u0_vec, dtype=float).copy()\n","    if A_mat is None:\n","        return np.maximum(u, 0.0)\n","    for k in range(1, Kloc):\n","        u[k] = u0_vec[k] + float(np.dot(A_mat[k, :k], z_vec[:k]))\n","    return np.maximum(u, 0.0)\n","\n","def simulate_trajectory(u_vec, v_vec, d_hat_vec, z_vec, I1, costs):\n","    f, c, h, p = costs\n","    Kloc = len(u_vec)\n","    I = np.zeros(Kloc)\n","    d_real = d_hat_vec + z_vec\n","    I[0] = I1 + u_vec[0] - d_real[0]\n","    for k in range(1, Kloc):\n","        I[k] = I[k-1] + u_vec[k] - d_real[k]\n","    y_pos = np.maximum(I, 0)\n","    y_neg = np.maximum(-I, 0)\n","    fixed = f * np.sum((v_vec > 0.5).astype(int))\n","    variable = c * np.sum(u_vec)\n","    holding = h * np.sum(y_pos)\n","    penalty = p * np.sum(y_neg)\n","    total = fixed + variable + holding + penalty\n","    service_rate = np.mean(I >= 0)\n","    stockouts = int(np.sum(I < 0))\n","    return dict(total=total, fixed=fixed, variable=variable, holding=holding, penalty=penalty,\n","                service_rate=service_rate, stockouts=stockouts, I_series=I)\n","\n","def evaluate(u0_vec, A_mat, v_vec, d_hat_vec, delta_vec, I1, costs, num_mc=300, seed=2025):\n","    rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n","    z0 = np.zeros_like(delta_vec)\n","    nom = simulate_trajectory(affine_policy_orders(u0_vec, A_mat, z0), v_vec, d_hat_vec, z0, I1, costs)\n","    z_plus = +delta_vec\n","    z_minus = -delta_vec\n","    plus = simulate_trajectory(affine_policy_orders(u0_vec, A_mat, z_plus), v_vec, d_hat_vec, z_plus, I1, costs)\n","    minus = simulate_trajectory(affine_policy_orders(u0_vec, A_mat, z_minus), v_vec, d_hat_vec, z_minus, I1, costs)\n","    mc = []\n","    for _ in range(num_mc):\n","        z = rng.uniform(low=-delta_vec, high=+delta_vec)\n","        mc.append(simulate_trajectory(affine_policy_orders(u0_vec, A_mat, z), v_vec, d_hat_vec, z, I1, costs))\n","    def agg(key):\n","        arr = np.array([it[key] for it in mc])\n","        return dict(mean=float(arr.mean()), std=float(arr.std()), p90=float(np.quantile(arr,0.9)),\n","                    p95=float(np.quantile(arr,0.95)), p99=float(np.quantile(arr,0.99)))\n","    totals = np.array([it['total'] for it in mc])\n","    var95 = float(np.quantile(totals, 0.95))\n","    cvar95 = float(totals[totals>=var95].mean())\n","    return dict(nominal=nom, plus=plus, minus=minus,\n","                mc=dict(total=agg('total'), service=agg('service_rate'), stockouts=agg('stockouts'),\n","                        VaR95=var95, CVaR95=cvar95))\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## 6) 评估 Shapley 策略，并尝试与 AAR 并排汇总\n","- 若你已在本 notebook 中定义了 `u0_sol`, `A_mat`, `v_sol`（或从 AAR 笔记本拷贝过来），则自动计算 `aar_eval` 并与 Shapley 对比。\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["costs_tuple = (f, c, h, p)\n","d_hat_eval = np.asarray(d_hat, dtype=float)\n","delta_eval = np.asarray(delta, dtype=float)\n","\n","# Shapley 评估\n","shp_eval = evaluate(u_shapley, None, v_shapley, d_hat_eval, delta_eval, I1, costs_tuple, num_mc=MC_SAMPLES, seed=MC_SEED)\n","\n","rows = [\n","    dict(method='Shapley', nominal_total=shp_eval['nominal']['total'], nominal_service=shp_eval['nominal']['service_rate'],\n","         worst_plus_total=shp_eval['plus']['total'], worst_minus_total=shp_eval['minus']['total'],\n","         MC_mean_total=shp_eval['mc']['total']['mean'], MC_std_total=shp_eval['mc']['total']['std'],\n","         MC_VaR95=shp_eval['mc']['VaR95'], MC_CVaR95=shp_eval['mc']['CVaR95'],\n","         MC_mean_service=shp_eval['mc']['service']['mean'])\n","]\n","\n","# 若存在 AAR 解，自动加入对比\n","try:\n","    _ = (u0_sol, A_mat, v_sol)  # noqa\n","    aar_eval = evaluate(u0_sol, A_mat, v_sol, d_hat_eval, delta_eval, I1, costs_tuple, num_mc=MC_SAMPLES, seed=MC_SEED)\n","    rows.insert(0, dict(method='AAR', nominal_total=aar_eval['nominal']['total'], nominal_service=aar_eval['nominal']['service_rate'],\n","                        worst_plus_total=aar_eval['plus']['total'], worst_minus_total=aar_eval['minus']['total'],\n","                        MC_mean_total=aar_eval['mc']['total']['mean'], MC_std_total=aar_eval['mc']['total']['std'],\n","                        MC_VaR95=aar_eval['mc']['VaR95'], MC_CVaR95=aar_eval['mc']['CVaR95'],\n","                        MC_mean_service=aar_eval['mc']['service']['mean']))\n","except NameError:\n","    pass\n","\n","summary = pd.DataFrame(rows)\n","summary"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## 7) 名义场景下成本拆解（可选）\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["nom_breakdown = pd.DataFrame([\n","    dict(method='Shapley', fixed=shp_eval['nominal']['fixed'], variable=shp_eval['nominal']['variable'],\n","         holding=shp_eval['nominal']['holding'], penalty=shp_eval['nominal']['penalty'], total=shp_eval['nominal']['total']),\n","]}],"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","language":"python","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"name":"python","version":"3.10"}},"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":5}